        "answer": {
          "short": "$0$, impossible",
          "worked": "No card is labelled 30.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{number }30)&=\\frac{0}{10}\\\\P(\\text{number }30)&=0\\end{align*}$$\n\nNo card qualifies, so this is impossible.",
